{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8263887830e2b40de5fddc6a9df439868566a12c14869d968da8be5773fddcd9", "ja": "（アジアンツアーでインドへ来た。間近で見たタージ・\nマハルの姿に、のり子はとても感動したようだ）", "zh": "（因为亚洲巡演来到了印度。亲眼看到泰姬陵的样子，看来律子非常感动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "13676bfedc5362b8d078de66b2072350ae5db3955a5919cac636f92429d8c98c", "ja": "ん～、さすが世界遺産！　装飾も豪華だったし、\nスケールの大きさにビックリしちゃったよ。", "zh": "嗯～，不愧是世界遗产！装饰也非常华丽，规模之大真是让我大吃一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1002_p", "source_sha256": "242faa8ba9e51b5c30a5229975df130018c24be23d2f9caf4b27bf99733fb465", "ja": "ああ、すごかったな。\nやっぱり実物は感動がまったく違うな！", "zh": "啊，真是太壮观了。\n果然亲眼看到实物，感动完全不一样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "bf647ae3e31efe1f8f636b5af9e977be627e2fe10250f5adb4863224df0af103", "ja": "ね！　みんなにいい土産話ができたよ。\n劇場に戻ったら、この感動を伝えなきゃ……！", "zh": "对吧！这下有很棒的见闻可以讲给大家听了。回到剧场后，一定要把这份感动传达给大家才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "bb2defebcb806a47406d9eb5aa4c8e1eadd76da66bcf344970ea928aabe482dc", "ja": "インドはいい国だよって。素敵な景色に美味しい料理♪\n魅力的な体験が、いっぱいあるしね！", "zh": "要告诉大家，印度是个很棒的国家哦。景色优美，还有美味的料理♪\n而且还有好多充满魅力的体验呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9c58a4659b89c92b826136d912c9a069da6ca83d768771fc51b73753f9aaf39b", "ja": "本当にそうだな。なんだか、のり子が行きたいって\n言ってた場所、全部回ってる気がするよ。", "zh": "确实是这样。总觉得，我们好像把典子说过想去的地方全都逛了一遍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "185fe1ec4e7519d4aea02e75ae1afeba5eed9c1b849b01199d4867c1490b0d93", "ja": "あはは、おかげで思ったよりお金使っちゃったけどね。\nでも、それだけ気になるものが多くて……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，虽然多亏这样，花得比预想的要多就是了。\n不过，这也是因为在意的玩意儿太多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "77f3294ee6e9232e67dd157daabb81813ae1acdeb9080f573a5533e36b8cfa30", "ja": "特にエステとか！　アレ、すっごく気持ちよくてさ。\nはあ～、最高だったな～♪", "zh": "尤其是美容护理之类的！那个特别舒服的。\n哈啊～真是太棒了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ea932e01a1a459fcd89e6dfef4f0dd0c45897e59b8408f9074dcc99f30af1ff2", "ja": "はは、いい体験ができたみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，看来你体验得很不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "afd758452c04d50cd8614bf3267f2f774a4152d38c77e12ef66e7d02fd1ab374", "ja": "うん！　エステ受けながら、このみさんと\n「日本でも探そう！」って約束しちゃった♪", "zh": "嗯！享受美容护理的时候，还和这由美小姐约好了“回日本也要找找看！”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "b90218dee8505bca1d954aaea8e431ff0e2fc11c38938c4df140c8f73130c5f2", "ja": "{$P$}も、一緒に受ければよかった\nのに……。日頃の疲れも吹き飛んじゃうって感じ！", "zh": "{$P$}要是也一起来做就好了\n……感觉平时的疲劳都会一扫而空呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1011_p", "source_sha256": "970ffbe6428d689eab7dd303124d57da9385484a70f4e408208c721eea2afd0b", "ja": "あの時は、エステか……って思ったんだけど。\nそこまで絶賛されると、流石に気になってきたな。", "zh": "当时我还觉得，美容院啊……\n被你这么大加称赞，我确实也开始有点好奇了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "267813a21581f9e37f5d60d9cfc5b3879794b790d531811fd75fa80cd3024fa0", "ja": "でしょ？　日本に帰ったら、早速お店探してみるね。\nこのみさんも誘って、みんなで行ってみようよ！", "zh": "对吧？回日本后，我马上找找看店家。也叫上木实小姐，大家一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "6cf1194cc0f679b8b8df1a2ca25bfedac817fbacddd561ee8bef949af1f15a7b", "ja": "ツアー終わりで、みんな疲れてると思うし……\nリフレッシュも兼ねて、ね♪", "zh": "巡演结束后，大家应该都累了吧……\n也顺便放松一下嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "ed29dae56c3522577bdb429326db6c08492a77e1331d99a71f16e2af332bdac5", "ja": "それで、エステの後はカレーを食べるの！\n帰国しても、インド気分は抜けないかも。えへへ♪", "zh": "所以，做完美容后要去吃咖喱！\n回国之后，说不定也还沉浸在印度的感觉里。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0473_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3593f8bcd245a776f152655780a80481e368d0456ff69d7bb912a9d2f84a647c", "ja": "（その後ものり子は、上機嫌で思い出話を語っていた。\nすっかりインドが気に入ったようだな……！）", "zh": "（之后，法子还兴致勃勃地讲着旅途中的回忆。\n看来她已经完全喜欢上印度了啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
